label "Bulkhead isolation diagram"
box a1 20 40 90 40 "agent A"
box a2 20 108 90 40 "agent B"
box a3 20 176 90 40 "tenant C"
region pools 150 26 130 200 "bounded pool per consumer"
box p1 165 40 100 40 "pool A|saturated" acc
box p2 165 108 100 40 "pool B"
box p3 165 176 100 40 "pool C"
box svc 330 96 110 64 "shared model|/ tool service"
arrow a1 p1
arrow a2 p2
arrow a3 p3
arrow p1 svc dashed
arrow p2 svc
arrow p3 svc
cross 300 88
note "pool A fails fast on its own — B and C never notice"
